* 4N35 for the KiCad schematic simulator.
* Pin order matches Sim.Pins on Isolator:4N25: anode, cathode, emitter, collector.
* CTR is 100% (0.005 × Bf 200). Base and the second collector stay open.
.subckt 4N35 A K E C
Dled A N D4N35
Vs N K 0
Fctr E B Vs 0.005
Qpt C B E Q4N35
.model D4N35 D(Is=1e-20 N=1.8 Rs=2)
.model Q4N35 NPN(Bf=200 Is=1e-14 Cjc=10p Cje=10p)
.ends
